{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 7970853220611572848,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "crypto_engine: Hardware Offload Framework",
      "source_hash": 10880702342217055688,
      "context_hash": 3693297979057544165,
      "translation": "crypto_engine: 하드웨어 오프로드 프레임워크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How hardware crypto accelerators plug into the kernel",
      "source_hash": 10146599991565865100,
      "context_hash": 18394552993909108182,
      "translation": "하드웨어 암호 가속기가 커널에 연결되는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem crypto_engine solves",
      "source_hash": 3534882714875960368,
      "context_hash": 6464767101210941837,
      "translation": "crypto_engine이 해결하는 문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Hardware crypto accelerators — STM32 CRYP, Allwinner CE, Marvell CESA, Intel QAT — all share the same fundamental I/O model: you program a DMA descriptor, the hardware processes it asynchronously, and you get an interrupt when it's done.",
      "source_hash": 1134458086081051978,
      "context_hash": 17385951641064345328,
      "translation": "하드웨어 암호 가속기(STM32 CRYP, Allwinner CE, Marvell CESA, Intel QAT)는 모두 동일한 기본 I/O 모델을 공유합니다. DMA 디스크립터를 프로그래밍하면 하드웨어가 이를 비동기적으로 처리하고, 처리가 끝나면 인터럽트가 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "Intel": "Intel",
        "descriptor": "디스크립터",
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Writing a driver that satisfies the kernel crypto API's `do_one_request()` contract correctly while managing hardware queuing, fallbacks, and error recovery requires a lot of boilerplate.",
      "source_hash": 16747602854191313896,
      "context_hash": 11876297773951143292,
      "translation": "하드웨어 큐잉, 폴백(fallback), 오류 복구를 관리하면서 커널 crypto API의 `do_one_request()` 계약을 올바르게 충족하는 드라이버를 작성하려면 많은 보일러플레이트 코드가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "fallback": "폴백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`crypto_engine` (introduced in kernel 3.19) provides a generic work-queue layer that sits between the crypto API and a hardware driver.",
      "source_hash": 16171424144838140263,
      "context_hash": 7972827198383387236,
      "translation": "`crypto_engine`(커널 3.19에서 도입)은 crypto API와 하드웨어 드라이버 사이에 위치하는 범용 작업 큐(work-queue) 계층을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:26:29.423062Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "It:",
      "source_hash": 2647418959242728900,
      "context_hash": 5536064477241100951,
      "translation": "이 계층의 역할은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Serializes requests to hardware that can only process one at a time",
      "source_hash": 4504600583664720129,
      "context_hash": 1720755962450616713,
      "translation": "한 번에 하나의 요청만 처리할 수 있는 하드웨어로 가는 요청의 직렬화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Handles retry when hardware is busy (enabled via `engine->retry_support = true`)",
      "source_hash": 7302243286999465780,
      "context_hash": 5857305736304410037,
      "translation": "하드웨어가 사용 중일 때의 재시도 처리(`engine->retry_support = true`로 활성화)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Calls driver callbacks at the right points (prepare → do → finalize)",
      "source_hash": 11096508065079357895,
      "context_hash": 11747686492003588640,
      "translation": "적절한 시점의 드라이버 콜백 호출(prepare → do → finalize)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Integrates with the async request completion path",
      "source_hash": 5031645955221849039,
      "context_hash": 8709478744455489036,
      "translation": "비동기 요청 완료 경로와의 통합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Without crypto_engine, each driver implements its own queue, its own retry logic, and its own locking — duplicating hundreds of lines of error-prone code.",
      "source_hash": 9036193014253153689,
      "context_hash": 16043038835701866034,
      "translation": "crypto_engine이 없으면 각 드라이버가 자체 큐, 자체 재시도 로직, 자체 락킹을 구현하게 되어 오류가 발생하기 쉬운 코드 수백 줄이 중복됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct crypto_engine",
      "source_hash": 2445835001605077549,
      "context_hash": 14712988212174464985,
      "translation": "struct crypto_engine",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Defined in the driver-internal header `include/crypto/internal/engine.h` (not the public `include/crypto/engine.h`):",
      "source_hash": 3920645690155516157,
      "context_hash": 6144776594208612898,
      "translation": "공개 헤더인 `include/crypto/engine.h`가 아니라 드라이버 내부 헤더인 `include/crypto/internal/engine.h`에 정의되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A dedicated kthread worker (`kworker`) runs `pump_requests` to dequeue and dispatch requests to hardware — not a generic workqueue.",
      "source_hash": 7277794188574275466,
      "context_hash": 11358083046241741056,
      "translation": "범용 workqueue가 아니라 전용 kthread worker(`kworker`)가 `pump_requests`를 실행하여 요청을 큐에서 꺼내 하드웨어로 전달합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "workqueue": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Most drivers allocate one engine per hardware channel, or one per device if the hardware is single-channel.",
      "source_hash": 11404768964794540285,
      "context_hash": 6013955392737853670,
      "translation": "대부분의 드라이버는 하드웨어 채널마다 엔진을 하나씩 할당하며, 하드웨어가 단일 채널이면 디바이스마다 하나씩 할당합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "drivers": "드라이버",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "There is no batching callback on this struct; see \"Batching\" below.",
      "source_hash": 3558284070821331780,
      "context_hash": 14743562381135478505,
      "translation": "이 구조체에는 배칭(batching) 콜백이 없습니다. 아래의 \"Batching\"을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백",
        "struct": "구조체"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Driver callbacks: crypto_engine_op",
      "source_hash": 9784181218287425901,
      "context_hash": 882411304857735891,
      "translation": "드라이버 콜백: crypto_engine_op",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each algorithm registered with crypto_engine provides a `struct crypto_engine_op`:",
      "source_hash": 14980869093387196294,
      "context_hash": 10461647125256218466,
      "translation": "crypto_engine에 등록된 각 알고리즘은 `struct crypto_engine_op`를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Callback",
      "source_hash": 11689681067771040504,
      "context_hash": 7829174395435387768,
      "translation": "콜백",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Called when",
      "source_hash": 3294592710185958062,
      "context_hash": 16225963134007488558,
      "translation": "호출 시점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Typical work",
      "source_hash": 11100087413132711618,
      "context_hash": 2965578553996659852,
      "translation": "일반적인 작업",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`do_one_request`",
      "source_hash": 523969792717570166,
      "context_hash": 15965157753152248360,
      "translation": "`do_one_request`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Hardware is idle, request at head of queue",
      "source_hash": 12639226389985739421,
      "context_hash": 12590870248110241475,
      "translation": "하드웨어가 유휴 상태이고 요청이 큐의 맨 앞에 있을 때",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Start DMA, return `-EINPROGRESS`",
      "source_hash": 10965820951095932931,
      "context_hash": 6431155302869138496,
      "translation": "DMA 시작, `-EINPROGRESS` 반환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`do_one_request` is required and is the only callback in current kernels.",
      "source_hash": 2503531986607433599,
      "context_hash": 14248866300927151297,
      "translation": "`do_one_request`는 필수이며 현재 커널에서 유일한 콜백입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백",
        "kernels": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "**Note**: Through kernel 6.5, `struct crypto_engine_op` was a single generic struct (not split by request type) with three callbacks: `prepare_request`, `unprepare_request`, and `do_one_request`.",
      "source_hash": 4687880793020072788,
      "context_hash": 10658272627338941736,
      "translation": "**참고**: 커널 6.5까지 `struct crypto_engine_op`는 요청 유형별로 나뉘지 않은 단일 범용 구조체였으며, `prepare_request`, `unprepare_request`, `do_one_request`의 세 가지 콜백을 가지고 있었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "The refactor to today's model — `do_one_request` only, wrapped in per-type structs like `skcipher_engine_alg` — landed between 6.5 and 6.6.",
      "source_hash": 11004789602530750009,
      "context_hash": 4671578920232638587,
      "translation": "`do_one_request`만 두고 이를 `skcipher_engine_alg` 같은 유형별 구조체로 감싸는 현재 모델로의 리팩터링은 6.5와 6.6 사이에 반영되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "structs": "구조체"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Algorithm registration: skcipher_engine_alg",
      "source_hash": 16889431966960833493,
      "context_hash": 16717082245770451368,
      "translation": "알고리즘 등록: skcipher_engine_alg",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030892Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The engine op is embedded in the algorithm descriptor struct, not in a per-transform context struct.",
      "source_hash": 8580278139888932100,
      "context_hash": 12836111624857942361,
      "translation": "엔진 op는 변환(transform)별 컨텍스트 구조체가 아니라 알고리즘 디스크립터 구조체에 내장됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "descriptor": "디스크립터",
        "struct": "구조체"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030892Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, `struct skcipher_engine_alg` wraps `struct skcipher_alg` with an appended `struct crypto_engine_op op`:",
      "source_hash": 11204449032149078863,
      "context_hash": 4557472935138916984,
      "translation": "예를 들어 `struct skcipher_engine_alg`는 `struct skcipher_alg`를 감싸고 그 뒤에 `struct crypto_engine_op op`를 덧붙입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:25.030892Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The same pattern applies for AEAD (`struct aead_engine_alg`), ahash (`struct ahash_engine_alg`), and akcipher (`struct akcipher_engine_alg`).",
      "source_hash": 15995258598892212238,
      "context_hash": 17229344628861415352,
      "translation": "AEAD(`struct aead_engine_alg`), ahash(`struct ahash_engine_alg`), akcipher(`struct akcipher_engine_alg`)에도 같은 패턴이 적용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Drivers embed the engine op inside the algorithm descriptor and register with the engine-aware helpers (e.g., `crypto_engine_register_skcipher()`) rather than the plain crypto API helpers.",
      "source_hash": 1304035790420052983,
      "context_hash": 15267248499191244555,
      "translation": "드라이버는 engine op를 알고리즘 디스크립터 안에 내장하고, 일반 crypto API 헬퍼 대신 엔진을 인식하는 헬퍼(예: `crypto_engine_register_skcipher()`)로 등록합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "descriptor": "디스크립터",
        "drivers": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How a driver uses crypto_engine",
      "source_hash": 743461997451085202,
      "context_hash": 6343235612275760818,
      "translation": "드라이버가 crypto_engine을 사용하는 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 1: allocate and start the engine in probe",
      "source_hash": 9633020697038014943,
      "context_hash": 16629786521795407756,
      "translation": "1단계: probe에서 엔진 할당 및 시작",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 2: register algorithms via crypto_engine helpers",
      "source_hash": 7059621869429003190,
      "context_hash": 13534568706262110623,
      "translation": "2단계: crypto_engine 헬퍼를 통한 알고리즘 등록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Instead of `crypto_register_skcipher()`, use the engine-aware wrapper:",
      "source_hash": 2766233220331753756,
      "context_hash": 14369663692488600379,
      "translation": "`crypto_register_skcipher()` 대신 엔진을 인식하는 래퍼를 사용하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 3: the encrypt/decrypt entry points enqueue the request",
      "source_hash": 5356264494554468670,
      "context_hash": 14532690583190462744,
      "translation": "3단계: encrypt/decrypt 진입점에서 요청을 큐에 넣기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "entry point": "진입점"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 4: do_one_request programs the hardware",
      "source_hash": 17527875674535621930,
      "context_hash": 8794648352315365116,
      "translation": "4단계: do_one_request에서 하드웨어 프로그래밍",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 5: complete from the interrupt handler",
      "source_hash": 10557164325995238510,
      "context_hash": 1677199956401809348,
      "translation": "5단계: 인터럽트 핸들러에서 완료 처리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt handler": "인터럽트 핸들러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "`crypto_finalize_skcipher_request()` (and equivalents for AEAD, ahash, akcipher) invokes the request's completion callback, then kicks the engine to pump the next queued request.",
      "source_hash": 9204649651336292651,
      "context_hash": 11083718999960276705,
      "translation": "`crypto_finalize_skcipher_request()`(및 AEAD, ahash, akcipher용 대응 함수)는 요청의 완료 콜백을 호출한 다음, 엔진을 깨워 큐에 있는 다음 요청을 처리하게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The fallback pattern",
      "source_hash": 17547957543014441149,
      "context_hash": 6844698406372405254,
      "translation": "폴백 패턴",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fallback": "폴백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Hardware accelerators often have limitations: they may not support all key sizes, all modes, or may be unavailable (e.g., during suspend).",
      "source_hash": 15040225094868419978,
      "context_hash": 8353475208630482422,
      "translation": "하드웨어 가속기에는 흔히 제약이 있습니다. 모든 키 크기나 모든 모드를 지원하지 않을 수 있고, 사용할 수 없는 상태일 수도 있습니다(예: suspend 중).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The standard pattern is to keep a software `fallback` transform and use it when the hardware can't handle a request.",
      "source_hash": 12492591382835896780,
      "context_hash": 7047252157407916394,
      "translation": "표준 패턴은 소프트웨어 `fallback` transform을 유지하다가 하드웨어가 요청을 처리할 수 없을 때 이를 사용하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The same pattern applies to AEAD (`struct aead_engine_alg`, `crypto_finalize_aead_request()`), ahash, and akcipher.",
      "source_hash": 6396902039491626809,
      "context_hash": 17378214889196088953,
      "translation": "AEAD(`struct aead_engine_alg`, `crypto_finalize_aead_request()`), ahash, akcipher에도 같은 패턴이 적용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Retry support",
      "source_hash": 16274334330286426932,
      "context_hash": 16805586170426235483,
      "translation": "재시도 지원",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When `engine->retry_support = true`, `crypto_pump_requests()` in `crypto/crypto_engine.c` handles a `do_one_request()` failure differently depending on the error:",
      "source_hash": 5132215925886753819,
      "context_hash": 2361332891673688134,
      "translation": "`engine->retry_support = true`이면 `crypto/crypto_engine.c`의 `crypto_pump_requests()`는 `do_one_request()` 실패를 오류 종류에 따라 다르게 처리합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**`-ENOSPC`**: only the single request that just failed is re-queued, at the *head* of the engine queue (`crypto_enqueue_request_head()`) to preserve ordering, and the pump is rescheduled to retry it on the next cycle.",
      "source_hash": 731495529978396143,
      "context_hash": 11082730908827387629,
      "translation": "**`-ENOSPC`**: 방금 실패한 그 요청 하나만 순서를 보존하기 위해 엔진 큐의 *맨 앞*에 다시 넣고(`crypto_enqueue_request_head()`), 다음 주기에 재시도하도록 펌프를 다시 스케줄합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "This handles drivers whose hardware command FIFOs can fill up under sustained load (e.g., Marvell CESA, Allwinner CE).",
      "source_hash": 3868755631986944681,
      "context_hash": 18047337398317168762,
      "translation": "이는 지속적인 부하에서 하드웨어 명령 FIFO가 가득 찰 수 있는 드라이버(예: Marvell CESA, Allwinner CE)를 위한 처리입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FIFO": "FIFO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Any other error**: the request fails immediately (`crypto_request_complete()`) regardless of retry support.",
      "source_hash": 7601002187569919433,
      "context_hash": 7666345830110217497,
      "translation": "**그 밖의 모든 오류**: 재시도 지원 여부와 관계없이 요청은 즉시 실패합니다(`crypto_request_complete()`).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The `CRYPTO_TFM_REQ_MAY_BACKLOG` flag is unrelated to this retry path — it governs backlog behavior when a request is first submitted to an already-full queue, not what happens after `do_one_request()` fails.",
      "source_hash": 13366036752340855892,
      "context_hash": 13374491908809312010,
      "translation": "`CRYPTO_TFM_REQ_MAY_BACKLOG` 플래그는 이 재시도 경로와 관계가 없습니다. 이 플래그는 `do_one_request()`가 실패한 뒤의 동작이 아니라, 이미 가득 찬 큐에 요청이 처음 제출될 때의 backlog 동작을 결정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Without retry support (or on any non-`-ENOSPC` error), a hardware failure causes the request to fail immediately with an error back to the caller.",
      "source_hash": 2433129255964345395,
      "context_hash": 10311620067282387718,
      "translation": "재시도 지원이 없으면(또는 `-ENOSPC`가 아닌 오류에서는) 하드웨어 실패 시 요청이 즉시 실패하고 호출자에게 오류가 반환됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Batching",
      "source_hash": 5017341252904914547,
      "context_hash": 5496712332051092621,
      "translation": "배치 처리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There is no batching callback in `crypto_engine` — `struct crypto_engine` has no `do_batch_requests`-style hook, and `crypto_pump_requests()` always dispatches exactly one request per `do_one_request()` call.",
      "source_hash": 8214398500945915654,
      "context_hash": 6255972519309941799,
      "translation": "`crypto_engine`에는 배치 처리 콜백이 없습니다. `struct crypto_engine`에는 `do_batch_requests` 형태의 훅이 없으며, `crypto_pump_requests()`는 항상 `do_one_request()` 호출 한 번에 정확히 요청 하나를 디스패치합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Hardware capable of submitting several requests in a single DMA pass (e.g., QAT) implements its own batching outside of `crypto_engine`, or processes requests one at a time through it regardless.",
      "source_hash": 14649384154789545080,
      "context_hash": 11415222848907939822,
      "translation": "한 번의 DMA 패스로 여러 요청을 제출할 수 있는 하드웨어(예: QAT)는 `crypto_engine` 바깥에서 자체 배치 처리를 구현하거나, 그와 상관없이 `crypto_engine`을 통해 요청을 하나씩 처리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:27.344870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
